# What a function of src/shell/ calls to read a file, list a directory, or resolve a path, read
# by tests/functional_core.rs: only the functions of functional_core.guarded may name it. One
# entry per line, matched as the forbidden list matches: wherever its segments appear in a path
# of the source, so that 'read_dir' finds 'fs::read_dir' and the method 'Path::read_dir'. A test
# of existence, as the bash's -e, -f, and -d, is no entry.

# Reading a file's bytes.
fs::read
read_to_string
File
OpenOptions

# Listing a directory.
read_dir

# Resolving a path, which decides whether it lies inside the repository.
canonicalize
